 ## Background
-The BasicDAGColorsBase class originates from the HashDAG project by Phyronnaz. It is part of the broader Sparse Voxel DAG (Directed Acyclic Graph) family, which aims to optimize volume rendering by sharing identical nodes to reduce memory footprint. The specific design choice to enclose leaf counts is intended to improve cache locality and traversal speed for the geometry array [S1, unofficial].
